# v2.1 rolling snapshot c6ffc141a8762b41703f9287d63d93622a13dd8f
# (https://github.com/LuaJIT/LuaJIT, official project, acquired through the
# GitHub mirror archive endpoint codeload.github.com).
#
# Archive digest of that snapshot, recorded by the driver from the downloaded
# tarball: 6e5fec07750add912e7c3eae0c194d24cd6d023714e1f04a0298a5b4819e4457
#
# 232 records. The set is every file this repository imported from that
# snapshot, with the exclusions stated below. LuaJIT is a self-contained C
# tree: there is no vendored third-party source subtree with its own separate
# grant, no bundled data set and no test fixture corpus. `dynasm/` (DynASM
# 1.5.0) and `doc/` are part of the project and carry its own notice.
#
# Deliberately absent, each for a stated reason:
#   .gitignore -- upstream's 12 lines are kept verbatim and this fork appends
#   its own Zig block, so the working-tree file is not byte-identical to
#   upstream's. Upstream's own bytes as imported are
#     f30157367c8ebe6b9f84d3921b48de2e92d4faa07aaa30da6aa3ec7f74ba584a  .gitignore
#   build.zig, build.zig.zon, cross-test.profile.sh, zig/, runtime/,
#   tests.zig, smoke.zig, consumer/, .github/workflows/verify.yml,
#   package.nix, flake.nix, devenv.nix, devenv.yaml, .envrc, README.md,
#   README.zig.md, CHANGELOG.md, FORK-NOTES.md, FORK-LICENSE.md, NOTICE.md,
#   UPSTREAM.md -- this fork's own files. The grant over them is recorded in
#   FORK-LICENSE.md and is not an upstream grant.
#
# src/luajit.h and src/luajit_relver.txt are absent from this repository and
# from this record. They are build-generated: src/Makefile:670-673 writes
# luajit.h from src/luajit_rolling.h by running src/host/genversion.lua, and
# src/Makefile:495 derives the rolling version either from `git show -s
# --format=%ct` or, when no .git directory is present, from the committed
# `../.relver` file. src/host/README:3 states that the host tools in that
# directory are build-time only and must not be installed; they are recorded
# here because the build graph runs them on the build host.
#
# Generated files that the build produces and that upstream .gitignore lists are
# therefore not recorded: src/luajit.h, src/luajit_relver.txt,
# src/lj_bcdef.h, src/lj_ffdef.h, src/lj_libdef.h, src/lj_recdef.h,
# src/lj_folddef.h, src/lj_vm.S, src/lj_vm.s, src/host/buildvm_arch.h and the
# front-end executable src/luajit.
#
# README.upstream.md and README carry the same digest: README.upstream.md is
# upstream's README moved aside so this fork could put its own README.md in
# in its place, with the bytes unchanged. Both are listed.

